# Secrets for the pi sandbox container. Copy to .env.secrets (git-ignored,
# chmod 600) and uncomment the keys you need — everything in this file is
# exported into the container's environment. Prefer narrow, short-lived
# keys over your main account keys.
#
# Anthropic (Claude models):
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...
#
# OpenAI:
# OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-...
#
# OpenRouter:
# OPENROUTER_API_KEY=sk-or-...
#
# NVIDIA / others as needed:
# NVIDIA_API_KEY=nvapi-...
#
# GitHub CLI (gh): token from `gh auth token` on the host — exported into
# the container and auto-logged-in by pi-entrypoint on boot (persists in
# the pi-agent-home volume, so it survives recreations):
# GH_TOKEN=gho_...
# GITHUB_TOKEN=gho_...
